<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Paribas unit 1996 net up 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Dutch Paribas unit 1996 net up 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  27.3  vs  16.5</p>
<p>    Interest income			   75.5  vs  69.0</p>
<p>    Fee income				  30.5  vs  28.9</p>
<p>    Income from financial transactions   8.1  vs   7.0</p>
<p>    Total income			     114.1  vs 104.9</p>
<p>    Total costs				 55.5  vs  58.4</p>
<p>    Loan loss provisions		    17.0  vs  30.0</p>
<p>    Tax					   12.8  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charge		     1.5  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Banque Paribas Nederland, a fully-owned Dutch unit of France's Banque Paribas, said it would continue to seek expansion in both corporate and private banking.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
